# Ignore Visual Studio temporary files, build results, and
# files generated by popular Visual Studio add-ons.

## Ignore Visual Studio cache and settings
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

## Ignore build results
bin/
obj/

## Ignore logs
*.log

## Ignore NuGet packages
packages/
*.nupkg

## Ignore Resharper and other add-ons
_ReSharper*/
*.[Rr]e[Ss]harper

## Ignore Azure build artifacts
csx/
*.build.csdef

## Ignore Visual Studio profiler
*.psess
*.vsp
*.vspx

## Ignore TFS local workspace
$tf/

## Ignore Rider IDE settings
.idea/

## Ignore DotCover
*.dotCover

## Ignore ASP.NET Scaffolding
ScaffoldingReadMe.txt

## Ignore Publish output
publish/

## Ignore StyleCop
StyleCopReport.xml

## Ignore node_modules for projects using Node.js
node_modules/

## Ignore other common files
*.dbmdl
*.bak
*.backup
*.mdf
*.ldf

## Ignore generated files
Generated_Code/

## Ignore coverage reports
coverage/
*.coverage
*.coveragexml

## Ignore temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp

## Ignore JetBrains Rider settings
.idea/

## Ignore Visual Studio Code settings
.vscode/

## Ignore Mac system files
.DS_Store

## Ignore Windows system files
Thumbs.db

